---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
---
<figure class="sbp10planonepage">
  <div class="sbp10planonepage-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 292" role="img" aria-label="Five written rules for a first-year plan: money, size, buy, sell and review.">
      <text x="20" y="30" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>A first-year plan fits on one page: five written rules</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Kế hoạch năm đầu vừa một trang giấy: năm quy tắc viết sẵn</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="52" width="164" height="196" rx="8" class="card" />
      <DiagramIcon name="goal" x={102.0} y={86} size={30} />
      <text x="102.0" y="130" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>1 Money</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1 Tiền</tspan></text>
      <text x="102.0" y="156" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Only money I can</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Chỉ tiền để được</tspan></text>
      <text x="102.0" y="174" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>leave 3+ years.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>3 năm trở lên.</tspan></text>
      <text x="102.0" y="192" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Emergency fund</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Quỹ khẩn cấp</tspan></text>
      <text x="102.0" y="210" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>stays in the bank.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>vẫn gửi ngân hàng.</tspan></text>
      <rect x="199" y="52" width="164" height="196" rx="8" class="card" />
      <DiagramIcon name="scale" x={281.0} y={86} size={30} />
      <text x="281.0" y="130" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>2 Size</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2 Tỷ trọng</tspan></text>
      <text x="281.0" y="156" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>No stock above</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Không mã nào quá</tspan></text>
      <text x="281.0" y="174" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>10% of the portfolio.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>10% danh mục.</tspan></text>
      <text x="281.0" y="192" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Risk 1% per idea.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Rủi ro 1% mỗi ý tưởng.</tspan></text>
      <rect x="378" y="52" width="164" height="196" rx="8" class="card" />
      <DiagramIcon name="calendar" x={460.0} y={86} size={30} />
      <text x="460.0" y="130" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>3 Buy</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>3 Mua</tspan></text>
      <text x="460.0" y="156" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Same amount, same</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cùng số tiền, cùng</tspan></text>
      <text x="460.0" y="174" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>day, every month.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>ngày, mỗi tháng.</tspan></text>
      <text x="460.0" y="192" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Limit orders only.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Chỉ dùng lệnh LO.</tspan></text>
      <rect x="557" y="52" width="164" height="196" rx="8" class="card" />
      <DiagramIcon name="stop" x={639.0} y={86} size={30} />
      <text x="639.0" y="130" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>4 Sell</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>4 Bán</tspan></text>
      <text x="639.0" y="156" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Thesis breaks, written</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Luận điểm sai, chạm giá</tspan></text>
      <text x="639.0" y="174" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>price hit, or over</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đã viết, hoặc vượt</tspan></text>
      <text x="639.0" y="192" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>the 10% cap.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>trần 10%.</tspan></text>
      <rect x="736" y="52" width="164" height="196" rx="8" class="card" />
      <DiagramIcon name="eye" x={818.0} y={86} size={30} />
      <text x="818.0" y="130" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>5 Review</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>5 Rà soát</tspan></text>
      <text x="818.0" y="156" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Once a quarter,</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mỗi quý một lần,</tspan></text>
      <text x="818.0" y="174" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>from the journal,</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>từ nhật ký,</tspan></text>
      <text x="818.0" y="192" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>not the price board.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>không nhìn bảng giá.</tspan></text>
      <text x="20" y="276" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>The numbers are a draft to set yourself: 3 years, 10%, 1%, monthly, quarterly.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Các con số là bản nháp để bạn tự đặt: 3 năm, 10%, 1%, hằng tháng, hằng quý.</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Write the five rules before the first order. Each later section fills in one of them with a real case.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Viết năm quy tắc trước lệnh đầu tiên. Mỗi phần sau điền một quy tắc bằng một tình huống thật.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
   .sbp10planonepage { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sbp10planonepage-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
   .sbp10planonepage svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
   .sbp10planonepage text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
   .sbp10planonepage .t { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
   .sbp10planonepage .h { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
   .sbp10planonepage .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
   .sbp10planonepage .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
   .sbp10planonepage .red { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
   .sbp10planonepage .green { fill: var(--act-2); font-weight: 700; }
   .sbp10planonepage .gold { fill: var(--act-1); font-weight: 700; }
   .sbp10planonepage .card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
   .sbp10planonepage .card-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
   .sbp10planonepage .card-green { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--act-2); stroke-width: 1.6; }
   .sbp10planonepage .card-gold { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.6; }
   .sbp10planonepage .ln { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
   .sbp10planonepage .axis { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 1.2; }
   .sbp10planonepage .dash { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
   .sbp10planonepage .arw { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; fill: none; }
   .sbp10planonepage .arw-h { fill: var(--text-muted); }
   .sbp10planonepage .bar-red { fill: var(--red); }
   .sbp10planonepage .bar-green { fill: var(--act-2); }
   .sbp10planonepage .bar-gold { fill: var(--gold); }
   .sbp10planonepage .bar-mut { fill: var(--text-faint); }
   .sbp10planonepage .path-line { fill: none; stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 2; stroke-linejoin: round; }
   .sbp10planonepage .path-red { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; stroke-linejoin: round; }
   .sbp10planonepage .dot { fill: var(--act-2); stroke: var(--bg); stroke-width: 1.5; }
   .sbp10planonepage .dot-red { fill: var(--red); stroke: var(--bg); stroke-width: 1.5; }
   .sbp10planonepage figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
